WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:05.547
♪♪

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:07.090
(Laughing)

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:22.981
♪♪

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:24.191
Flora:
I've seen it over and over.

00:00:24.191 --> 00:00:26.068
♪♪

00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:27.861
Flora:
Nine times out of ten they get
away with it. 

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:30.822
♪♪

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:32.157
Announcer:
I’d just like to welcome you
all.

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:34.243
Announcer:
It’s so good to see all the
University grads.

00:00:34.243 --> 00:00:38.372
♪♪

00:00:38.372 --> 00:00:40.415
(Text rings)

00:00:40.415 --> 00:01:00.852
♪♪

00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:02.104
Flora:
Remember our first case
together?

00:01:02.104 --> 00:01:03.438
Flora:
The one we couldn't solve?

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:05.315
♪♪

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:06.441
Flora:
There's another body.

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:08.026
All the same suspects.

00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:10.028
Flora:
But this time Sulli I'm gonna
go all the way.

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:12.155
♪♪

00:01:12.155 --> 00:01:13.949
You didn't take the blackmail
seriously?

00:01:13.949 --> 00:01:14.533
Sofia:
Why would we?

00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:15.951
We haven't done anything wrong.

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:17.411
♪♪

00:01:17.411 --> 00:01:19.663
You won't leave a warrant
to bug the mayoral candidate.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.290
You wanna go to war with those
guys?

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:53.113
♪♪

